OL,3,GNEWSAHockney helped to create new art
OL,4,Ashow in home city
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new exhibition celebrating the work
OL,7,Fof David Hockney in his home city had
OL,8,Finput from the globally renowned artist
OL,9,Fprior to his death, its curator said.
OL,11,FHockney, who died in June aged 88, was
OL,12,Finvolved in approving the inclusion of
OL,13,Fnew works in the reopened David Hockney
OL,14,FGallery at Cartwright Hall Art Gallery.
OL,16,FCurator Jill Iredale said there was now
OL,17,Fan "additional poignancy" to the show,
OL,18,Fwhich is free to enter and runs until
OL,19,F21 October 2029.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
