OL,3,GNEWSAHockney helped to create new art
OL,4,Ashow in home city
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors to the gallery in Manningham
OL,7,Fwill be able to see some of Hockney's
OL,8,Fchoices, including images of his French
OL,9,Fhome in Normandy made using sketches
OL,10,Fand an inkjet printer.
